<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Double Final Consonants</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@400;700;900&family=Caveat:wght@500;700&display=swap');

  body {
    font-family: 'Noto Sans KR', sans-serif;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    background-color: #f5f5f5;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .page-container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 850px;
    background-color: #ffffff;
    padding: 40px 50px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
  }

  /* Typography & Colors */
  .pink-ink {
    color: #c2185b;
    font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 1.2em;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
  }
  .black-ink {
    font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 1.1em;
    color: #000;
  }
  .text-gray {
    color: #666;
  }

  /* Header Section */
  .page-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    background-color: #f4a7a3;
    border-radius: 25px;
    padding: 12px 30px;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    color: white;
  }
  .header-title {
    display: flex;
    align-items: baseline;
    gap: 15px;
  }
  .header-title .ko {
    font-size: 28px;
    font-weight: 900;
  }
  .header-title .en {
    font-size: 16px;
    color: #c0392b;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-note {
    margin-left: auto;
    font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 26px;
    color: #000;
    font-weight: bold;
  }

  /* Audio Tag */
  .audio-tag-container {
    text-align: right;
    margin-bottom: 5px;
    padding-right: 10px;
  }
  .audio-tag {
    display: inline-block;
    background-color: #e8c547;
    color: white;
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: bold;
    padding: 2px 6px;
    border-radius: 2px;
    position: relative;
    margin-left: 10px;
  }
  .audio-tag::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    left: -4px;
    top: 50%;
    transform: translateY(-50%);
    border-top: 4px solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 4px solid transparent;
    border-right: 4px solid #e8c547;
  }

  /* Main Table Section */
  .main-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .main-table tr.bg-pink {
    background-color: #fdf2f2;
  }
  .main-table tr.bg-white {
    background-color: #ffffff;
  }
  .main-table td {
    padding: 12px 5px;
    vertical-align: middle;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .main-table td.col-note {
    background-color: #ffffff;
    text-align: right;
    padding-right: 15px;
    vertical-align: top;
    width: 120px;
    border: none;
  }
  .note-block {
    margin-top: 15px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .col-cons {
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 18px;
    width: 12%;
  }
  .col-pink-letter {
    width: 8%;
    font-size: 22px;
  }
  .col-phonetics {
    width: 15%;
    font-size: 15px;
  }
  .col-examples {
    width: 40%;
  }
  .col-ex-phonetics {
    width: 25%;
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .stacked-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    line-height: 1.3;
  }
  .stacked-text .ko-text {
    font-size: 16px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }

  /* Rules Section */
  .rules-section {
    margin: 10px 0 40px 140px;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }
  .rule-line {
    margin-bottom: 5px;
  }

  /* Words Section */
  .words-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .words-title {
    font-size: 22px;
    font-weight: 900;
    margin-right: 10px;
  }
  .words-badge {
    background-color: #f4a7a3;
    color: white;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 3px 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-right: 15px;
  }
  .dotted-line {
    flex-grow: 1;
    border-bottom: 2px dotted #dcdcdc;
  }
  .instruction {
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .bullet {
    display: inline-block;
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    background-color: #a0a0a0;
    border-radius: 50%;
    margin-right: 8px;
  }
  .en-inst {
    color: #888;
    margin-left: 5px;
  }

  /* Practice Table */
  .practice-table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
  }
  .practice-table td {
    border: 1px solid #eaeaea;
    width: 25%;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 15px 10px;
  }
  .practice-table tr:first-child td {
    background-color: #fdf2f2;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;
  }
  .practice-table tr:last-child td {
    height: 80px;
    vertical-align: middle;
  }
  .stacked-practice {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .practice-ko {
    font-size: 26px;
    font-weight: bold;
    margin: 8px 0;
  }
  .practice-en {
    font-size: 11px;
    color: #888;
  }
  .handwritten-ko {
    font-family: 'Caveat', cursive;
    font-size: 36px;
    color: #000;
  }

  /* Footer */
  .footer {
    text-align: right;
    margin-top: 50px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: #444;
  }
  .footer strong {
    font-size: 18px;
    margin-left: 8px;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page-container">

  <!-- Header -->
  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="header-title">
      <span class="ko">겹받침</span>
      <span class="en">Double Final Consonants</span>
    </div>
    <div class="header-note">
      注意双音 (遇中连音)
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Audio Tag -->
  <div class="audio-tag-container">
    <span class="audio-tag">033</span>
  </div>

  <!-- Main Table -->
  <table class="main-table">
    <tr class="bg-pink">
      <td class="col-note"></td>
      <td class="col-cons">ㄲ, ㄳ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">k</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㄱ][k]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">pak mok</span>
          <span class="ko-text">밖 몫</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[박] [목]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="bg-white">
      <td class="col-note"><span class="pink-ink">发左边辅音</span></td>
      <td class="col-cons">ㄵ, ㄶ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">n</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㄴ][n]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">an da man ta</span>
          <span class="ko-text">앉다 많다</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[안따] [만타]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="bg-pink">
      <td class="col-note"></td>
      <td class="col-cons">ㅆ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">t</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㄷ][t]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">it da</span>
          <span class="ko-text">있다</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[읻따]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="bg-white">
      <td class="col-note"></td>
      <td class="col-cons">ㄼ, ㄾ, ㅀ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">l</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㄹ][l]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">yeo deol hal da sil ta neol da</span>
          <span class="ko-text">여덟 넓다 핥다 싫다</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[여덜] [널따] [할따] [실타]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="bg-pink">
      <td class="col-note"></td>
      <td class="col-cons">ㅄ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">p</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㅂ][p]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">kap eop da eop seo</span>
          <span class="ko-text">값 없다 없어</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[갑] [업따] [업써]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="bg-white">
      <td class="col-note" rowspan="3">
        <div class="note-block">
          <span class="pink-ink">发右边辅音</span><br>
          <span class="black-ink">遇元音发母音</span><br>
          <span class="black-ink">才发右边音</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-cons">ㄻ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">m</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㅁ][m] [ㄹ][l]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">ceom da sam da sal mi</span>
          <span class="ko-text">젊다 삶다 삶이</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[점따] [삼따] [살미]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="bg-pink">
      <td class="col-cons">ㄿ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">p</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㅂ][p] [ㄹ][l]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">eup da eul peo</span>
          <span class="ko-text">읊다 읊어</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[읍따] [을퍼]</td>
    </tr>
    <tr class="bg-white">
      <td class="col-cons">ㄺ</td>
      <td class="col-pink-letter"><span class="pink-ink">k</span></td>
      <td class="col-phonetics">[ㄱ][k] [ㄹ][l]</td>
      <td class="col-examples">
        <div class="stacked-text">
          <span class="pink-ink">ik da mak da tal gi mal go</span>
          <span class="ko-text">읽다 맑다 닭이 맑고</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td class="col-ex-phonetics">[익따] [막따] [달기] [말꼬]</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- Rules Section -->
  <div class="rules-section">
    <div class="rule-line black-ink">① ㄶ, ㅀ 后接 ㄱ, ㄷ, ㅈ 变为送气音 k, t, c</div>
    <div class="rule-line black-ink">② ㄶ, ㅀ 后接 아 等母音 变为 나, 라</div>
  </div>

  <!-- Words Section -->
  <div class="words-header">
    <span class="words-title">단어</span>
    <span class="words-badge">Words</span>
    <div class="dotted-line"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="instruction">
    <span class="bullet"></span> 다음 단어를 읽고 쓰십시오. <span class="en-inst">Read the words and write.</span>
    <span class="audio-tag">034</span>
  </div>

  <table class="practice-table">
    <tr>
      <td>
        <div class="stacked-practice">
          <span class="black-ink">pak</span>
          <span class="practice-ko">밖</span>
          <span class="practice-en">outdoor</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td>
        <div class="stacked-practice">
          <span class="black-ink">an da</span>
          <span class="practice-ko">앉다</span>
          <span class="practice-en">to sit</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td>
        <div class="stacked-practice">
          <span class="black-ink">man ta</span>
          <span class="practice-ko">많다</span>
          <span class="practice-en">many, much</span>
        </div>
      </td>
      <td>
        <div class="stacked-practice">
          <span class="black-ink">it da</span>
          <span class="practice-ko">있다</span>
          <span class="practice-en">to have, there is</span>
        </div>
      </td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span class="handwritten-ko">밖</span></td>
      <td><span class="handwritten-ko">앉다</span></td>
      <td><span class="handwritten-ko">많다</span></td>
      <td><span class="handwritten-ko">있다</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <!-- Footer -->
  <div class="footer">
    1-3 한글을 배워요 ③ <strong>53</strong>
  </div>

</div>

</body>
</html>
```
